  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "又見面啦！我們這次要拍攝的是\n驚聲尖叫的恐慌畫面。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C8898B97625566FF016211501190196B21898162CD651D7684662F000A9A5A80725C1653EB76846050614C756B9762300200100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次竟然是古代的寶可夢\n在現代甦醒，到處大鬧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B217ADF7136662F53E44EE376845BF653EF5922000A572873FE4EE375269192FF0C5230865559279B27FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我想要拍攝被稱為\n古代王者的怪顎龍……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621160F3898162CD651D88AB7A3170BA000A53E44EE3738B80057684602A984E9F8D2026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是那樣就必須要讓牠從\n昂貴的化石中復原不是嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F90A36A235C315FC5980889818B9372605F9E000A66028CB47684531677F34E2D5FA9539F4E0D662F55CEFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我正在等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562116B6357287B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B34F86FF01FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓化石復原\n並進化成怪顎龍了的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n能不能請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙拍攝呢！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF015982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B93531677F35FA9539F000A4E26903253166210602A984E9F8D4E8676848A71FF0C00100001BE00000A80FD4E0D80FD8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD962CD651D5462FF01FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也當\n臨時演員入鏡的！拜託了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B21621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F7576000A81E866426F1454E1516593E17684FF0162DC8A174E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫忙拍攝的話，\n希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能將怪顎龍加入同行隊伍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B5FD962CD651D76848A71FF0C000A5E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5C07602A984E9F8D52A05165540C884C968A4F0DFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒預算的話辦不到吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9298107B9776848A718FA64E0D52305427300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼古代的寶可夢，\n根本連見都沒見過……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBC53E44EE376845BF653EF5922FF0C000A6839672C9023898B90FD6C92898B904E2026202600100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒想到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真的把怪顎龍帶來了！？\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫忙拍攝對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9260F3523000100003110000FF01014F6059B3771F7684628A602A984E9F8D5E364F864E86FF01FF1F000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B5FD962CD651D5C0D5427FF1F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗚……既然如此只能由\n導演自己穿著布偶裝入鏡了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55DA2026202665E2713659826B6453EA80FD7531000A5C0E6F1481EA5DF17A7F84575E03507688DD516593E14E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一直都相信著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n臨時演員的部分也要好好發揮喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0076F490FD76F84FE1845700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A81E866426F1454E1768490E852064E5F8981597D597D767C63EE5594FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大家，拜託啦！\n預備……Action！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BB6FF0C62DC8A175566FF01000A98105099202620260041006300740069006F006EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂……你看！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582202620264F60770BFF0100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃隆～～～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54439686FF5EFF5EFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是什麼……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F4EC09EBC20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怪……怪獸！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "602A20262026602A7378FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠往這邊過來了！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72605F809019908A904E4F864E86FF01FF0100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕隆～～～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54959686FF5EFF5EFF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5361FF5EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為什麼跟主人撒嬌啦！\n形象都毀光光了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4EC09EBC8DDF4E3B4EBA64925B0C5566FF01000A5F628C6190FD6BC0514951494E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那個……導演。\n別看怪顎龍這樣，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但牠其實好像可以學會撒嬌的招式喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3500B202620265C0E6F143002000A5225770B602A984E9F8D90196A23FF0C00100001BE00000A4F46726051765BE6597D50CF53EF4EE55B78670364925B0C768462DB5F0F5594300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說即使牠性情粗暴，\n對訓練家可是羞答答的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA53734F7F7260602760C57C9766B4FF0C000A5C0D8A137DF45BB653EF662F7F9E7B547B5476845462300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼！？\n原來牠是不能跟主人同台演出的嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF01FF1F000A539F4F867260662F4E0D80FD8DDF4E3B4EBA540C53F06F1451FA768455CEFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不對，等等喔。\n與人心靈相通的古代的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C0DFF0C7B497B4955943002000A82074EBA5FC3974876F8901A768453E44EE376845BF653EF59222026202600100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這好像也不錯！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019597D50CF4E5F4E0D932FFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "導演，沒問題嗎？\n每次都跟預定的不一樣耶。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0E6F14FF0C6C92554F984C55CEFF1F000A6BCF6B2190FD8DDF98105B9A76844E0D4E006A238036300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哼哼……無須多慮！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54FC54FC2026202671219808591A616EFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "系列作的主題已經不是\n「野生寶可夢的可怕之處」了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7CFB52174F5C76844E3B984C5DF27D934E0D662F000A300C91CE751F5BF653EF5922768453EF60154E4B8655300D4E86FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而是「與野生寶可夢的共生」！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C662F300C820791CE751F5BF653EF592276845171751F300DFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到目前為止拍攝到的溫馨畫面\n全部都和這個主題非常合拍！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "523076EE524D70BA6B6262CD651D523076846EAB99A8756B9762000A516890E890FD548C9019500B4E3B984C975E5E38540862CDFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "比起單純地描寫牠們的恐怖，\n這更適合現在的密阿雷啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD48D7755AE7D14573063CF5BEB72605011768460506016FF0C000A901966F49069540873FE572876845BC6963F96F7554AFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讚啦……！\n這絕對會大賣的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9A556620262026FF01000A90197D555C0D670359278CE37684FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這麼大膽地轉換方向也是多虧了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n感謝！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199EBC592781BD57308F4963DB65B954114E5F662F591A86674E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A611F8B1DFF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "描寫與寶可夢共生的電影……\n絕對會大賣的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63CF5BEB82075BF653EF59225171751F768496FB5F7120262026000A7D555C0D670359278CE37684FF0100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本來我是為了報酬才來的……\n但和那位導演一起的話，是成不了明星的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C4F866211662F70BA4E865831916C624D4F86768420262026000A4F46548C90A34F4D5C0E6F144E008D7776848A71FF0C662F62104E0D4E86660E661F7684300200100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不只是怪顎龍，\n所有的寶可夢都很可愛呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EA662F602A984E9F8DFF0C000A6240670976845BF653EF592290FD5F8853EF611B5462300200100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
